            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalFeature",
            "paragraph": "However, because of the demonstrated impact of a higher vertical resolution on tracer transport (Ganzeveld et al., 2008), the measurements were also compared with a 60 layer (L60) version of the SCM with 13 layers in the CBL.",
